&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role is within &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Goat Agency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, a leading brand within WPP Media, where you will be instrumental in &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW221406265 BCX4&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW221406265 BCX4&quot;&gt;helping global brands harness the power of social and creator-led content to deliver measurable impact. Recognised as a global leader in the space, we deliver award-winning campaigns in more than 70 countries. With over 650 social natives worldwide, we create ambitious influencer programmes from tactical activations to long-term partnerships, designed to drive awareness,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW221406265 BCX4&quot;&gt;engagement &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW221406265 BCX4&quot;&gt;and conversions across the full marketing funnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being responsible for the day-to-day management of various influencer and social marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on proposals for prospective clients by identifying the correct mechanic, influencers and creative for each brand and their target audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending pitches for prospective clients and assisting the Account Manager in client phone calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking responsibility for ensuring numerous KPIs are hit and campaigns are delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing and managing large budgets on multiple influencer campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting on campaigns and liaising with account managers to ensure the client is happy with the results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 1 year of relevant experience planning and executing Influencer campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience delegating and prioritising an ever-changing workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competent writing and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work effectively and calmly under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand Influencer Marketing and Social Metrics (Impressions / Reach / Engagements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
